#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut19_layout
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  430
#! poster  420
#! crop    0 0 1100 680
#! keys
# commit on leave: the title edited and escape (the title as it was, no star), edited again and enter (committed: the
# star); lx set to 0: two problems above the tree; Body picked; a click on the first problem shows Grid, its lx field
# taking the keys; 1.5 typed; View > Larger text: every size in em grows with the font
0   move 600 300
15  move 170 111 12
30  down
31  up
40  key end
48  text  B
70  key escape
90  down
91  up
100 key end
108 text  B
125 key enter
145 move 700 136 12
160 down
161 up
170 key ctrl down
171 key a
172 key ctrl up
180 text 0
190 key enter
210 move 424 240 12
225 down
226 up
245 move 450 62 12
262 down
263 up
275 key ctrl down
276 key a
277 key ctrl up
283 text 1.5
293 key enter
315 move 157 11 12
330 down
331 up
345 move 190 133 10
360 down
361 up
375 move 700 300 15
